# Boost modal kill switch

The boost upsell modal is temporarily disabled. Leave it off until someone asks to turn it back on.

To re-enable: in `app.js`, change `const BOOST_MODAL_ENABLED = false` to `true`. The constant sits next to `BOOST_MODAL_OPEN_DELAY_MS`. It gates `showBoostModal`, `prewarmBoostModalResources`, and `hasBoostLabel`. While it is false, choosing a plan with a `boost` or `boostCampaign` label skips the modal and continues to the next step.

After turning it on, select a membership that still has the boost label (for example Student & Youth Medlemskab, product 539, business unit 13). The boost modal should open instead of auto-advancing to checkout.
